# 19. Why This Is a Good API/UI Relationship

Your application then has a very clear hierarchy:

```text
                    DataServ
                       │
             ┌─────────┴─────────┐
             │                   │
         Dataset API          Web UI
             │                   │
             │            visual interface
             │                   │
             └─────────┬─────────┘
                       │
                 same operations
```

A developer can:

### Use the UI

```text
Select age > 30
        ↓
Run Query
```

or:

### Copy the generated URL

```text
GET /datasets/123/query?age_gt=30
```

and put it in:

```javascript
fetch(...)
```

or:

```python
requests.get(...)
```

or:

```java
RestClient.get(...)
```

The UI isn't doing something magical that the API can't do.

